  [ceiling · answered] Functional lower B-fill fitting pocket: the flat underside at world Z251.4 clears the fixed lower elbow and retains its 3.05 mm roof to Z254.45. This open-bottom dry pocket receives the fitting before the lid closes. Retain Tree(auto)/Default support decisions; actual support release, retention force and print quality are unqualified.
    alternatives: Filling the pocket obstructs the elbow. Changing its ceiling or fitting station requires reconciling the fixed reservoir stem and direct link; the flat pocket preserves those selected interfaces.
